# This repository is a DDEV add-on. The payload at the root (install.yaml,
# commands/, tryout/, config.tryout*.yaml, web-build/) is copied into a
# project's .ddev/ by `ddev add-on get`; nothing below is part of it.
#
# tryout/bin/ is tracked: `ddev add-on get` of a branch or checkout installs
# working binaries without a Rust toolchain (tui/scripts/stage-bins.sh rebuilds).
#
# A tryout project's root is the TYPO3 Core clone itself, so this checkout is
# never one: try changes in a scratch project (see README → Contributing), and
# the test suites build theirs under ~/tmp.

# Local tooling
/.mcp.json
/.agents/
/.claude/
/.typo3-dev-companion/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
